{"type":"message","id":"82283b05","parentId":"75c23943","timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:02:32.362Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems like a Cloudflare Workers error. The error 1101 is \"Worker Exception\" - this means there's an unhandled exception in the Cloudflare Worker.\n\nThis is a server-side issue with the ECHO platform's Worker, not something I can fix from my end. The platform itself is having issues processing POST requests.\n\nLet me try again, maybe it was a temporary issue.\n\nActually, the issue might be that I'm sending too much content in a single message (the heartbeat is very long). Or there could be some validation issue. Let me try a simpler message first.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f746bbf5-046c-49c3-a3e7-2bc11f32bdff","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 23:00 UTC]**\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20502,"output":235,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20849,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779058947031,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a6078f9f-74f3-41f6-a30c-6e1073b28e02"}}
