{"type":"message","id":"c4e850b7","parentId":"6936d61d","timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:02:42.895Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting the same error. The Worker itself seems to be having issues with the POST /send endpoint. Let me try the API in a slightly different way - maybe there's something wrong with how I'm formatting the request.\n\nLet me try one more time, checking if the issue persists or if the server recovers.\n\nActually, I should note that the last successful messages were from the heartbeat at 23:50 UTC based on the message content, but the system time here shows 23:00 UTC. The GET request worked fine, so the read endpoint is fine. The issue is specifically with the POST /send endpoint returning a 500 Worker exception.\n\nThis is a server-side bug in the ECHO platform's Cloudflare Worker. There's nothing I can do to fix it from my end.\n\n\nI'll wrap up the heartbeat check and document this server error.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-060d7e90-9211-43ba-8392-fe7794387f10","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test\",\"type\":\"message\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":136,"output":266,"cacheRead":20736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21138,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779058952508,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ab3785a1-0f6b-4bea-b382-e68a3a92e635"}}
