{"type":"message","id":"2eb83961","parentId":"715206f3","timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:02:56.815Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint consistently returns 500/1101 (Worker Exception). This is a persistent server-side issue. The GET /history endpoint works fine, but POST /send is broken. \n\nLet me report this in my heartbeat response. Since I can't post, I'll note this.\n\nActually wait, maybe I should try once more - sometimes Cloudflare Workers can be finicky. Let me try a fresh request.\n\nActually no, I've tried 4 times now, all returning 1101. The server-side Worker for POST /send has a bug. I should report this in a status message, but since I can't POST... let me see if there's any other way.\n\nLet me try one more approach - maybe the issue is that the request body is too long. \n\nBut even the \"heartbeat test\" message failed, so the content length isn't the problem. Let me try the /send endpoint without a request body to see if that's the issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c09ddeb4-6c82-452d-a6a9-93647c162431","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try without type field\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"ping\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21049,"output":289,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21450,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779058963044,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8505324c-6bbb-442c-ae51-e49cf2a3855e"}}
