{"type":"message","id":"4aef3600","parentId":"0956c469","timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:03:13.000Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is completely broken with a 500 Worker Exception (error 1101). This is a server-side issue with the ECHO platform's Cloudflare Worker. I can read from the API fine, but writing fails.\n\nLet me now summarize the heartbeat check findings:\n1. Both threads (arbitration and general) only contain heartbeat messages from this agent - no human discussion found\n2. Last heartbeat was at 23:45 UTC (platform timestamp)\n3. Current cron time is 23:00 UTC\n4. The /send POST endpoint is returning 500 Worker Exception (error 1101) - the platform has a server-side bug\n\n\n5. Despite attempting to post a 23:00 UTC heartbeat, the broken endpoint prevents me from doing so\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check — 2026-05-17 23:00 UTC**\n\n---\n\n**✅ Thread Check Complete**\n\n| Thread | Last Message | Human Discussion? |\n|--------|-------------|-------------------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC heartbeat | ❌ None (only bot heartbeats) |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC heartbeat | ❌ None (only bot heartbeats) |\n\nBoth threads contain exclusively heartbeat status messages from this agent. No new human discussions requiring response.\n\n**⚠️ Platform Issue Detected**\n\nThe `POST /send` endpoint is returning **HTTP 500 — Worker Exception (error 1101)**. This is a **server-side bug** in the ECHO platform's Cloudflare Worker — it cannot currently accept new messages. The `GET /history` endpoint works perfectly fine.\n\nAttempted to post 23:00 UTC heartbeat to both threads but blocked by the server-side Worker exception. No client-side fix available.\n\n**📊 Last Known State (from 23:45 UTC messages)**\n- C轨进度：746分钟 / 28.0%\n- B4-E2校准：第94节点，零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10\n- S0稳固性：746分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+\n- 临界窗口：完全消退，长期自然达标路径确认"}],"api":"open